      "title": "\u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 Z-Image AI Upscaler",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 Z-Image AI Upscaler\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 UNETLoader\n**Model:** `z-image-turbo_fp8_scaled_e5m2_KJ.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/z-image/`\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 CLIPLoader\n**Model:** `Huihui-Qwen3-4B-abliterated-v2_fp8mixed.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/`\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 VAELoader\n**Model:** `ae.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 UpscaleModelLoader\n**Model:** `4x_NMKD-Siax_200k.pth`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/upscale_models/`\n> Used for initial 4x before AI refinement\n\n---\n## \ud83e\udde9 Required Custom Nodes\n- None \u2014 all core nodes\n\n---\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips\n- Uses Z-Image to add detail during upscale \u2014 higher quality than ESRGAN alone\n- Prompt with 'masterpiece, 8K' to guide the detail enhancement pass\n- Use VAEDecodeTiled for large outputs to avoid VRAM OOM\n\n---\n## \ud83d\udcda ApexForge\n\ud83d\ude80 **All models are pre-installed on your pod.**\n\ud83c\udfa8 **Just load this workflow and start generating.**"
      ],
      "color": "#231535",
      "bgcolor": "#3f2460"
    }
